		(property "Note" "Q2 (BSS84) gate-source clamp, cathode to +12V (source), anode to the gate (review M2, 2026-10-12). With Q3 on, R13/R14 put -0.91 x V12 on Vgs: -21.8 V at a 24 V jump start and -35 V at D1's 38.9 V clamp, past BSS84's +/-20 V. 15 V clamp; worst case (38.9-15)/10k = 2.4 mA, 36 mW. Same part and reason as D3 on Q1."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
