		(property "Note" "Series resistor (1k): buys input-protection headroom (SBAS680: higher source impedance raises the OVP range) and limits TVS clamp current into U8. U8's input leakage is (VIN - 2.50 V)/RIN with RIN ~1 Mohm (SBAS680 7.5): the equal resistor on AIN_nGND cancels the OFFSET term only; a GAIN error of R/RIN = ~0.1 % remains and is calibrated out with the channel (review minor 3)."
