		(property "Note" "PU_EN (GPIO21) pull-down. Holds Q3 off whenever the Pi's GPIO is high-Z - off, booting, or crashed - so the K-line pull-up defaults to disconnected and the board cannot perturb an NT510/UpRev session it is only meant to be sniffing. Safety-relevant despite being a plain resistor."
