		(property "Note" "CAN FD controller. Requires a 40, 20 or 4 MHz reference; rev 2.1 clocks it from Y1, a 40 MHz 8 pF fundamental crystal (CX3225SA) with 8.2 pF C0G load caps and R43 in series with OSC2, so the overlay keeps oscillator=40000000. Start-up margin ~4.5x at gm min (rev 2.0's 18 pF ABLS2 had 0.8-1.3x). RXCAN Vil = 0.3 x VDD = 0.99V, which is the margin D6's activity LED on the RXD net sits against."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
