		(property "Quote" "Rev 2.1: PCBWay sources and fits C2 (operator, 2026-10-12); not yet quoted. Rev 2.0 had it self-sourced and not populated at the assembler, after quote T-B4W341056A flagged the old 100uF value, since corrected to 47uF - see Note."
