		)
		(property "Note" "DO NOT POPULATE at the assembler: the operator sources and fits J1. Part: a 2x20, 2.54 mm Raspberry Pi stacking header with a 13.5 mm (extended-height) female body, whose long pins come through the HAT. 13.5 mm is the height that clears the Pi 5 active cooler (~6.3 mm above the fan, measured on the stack, CANary-HAT-Rev2.1.md 13.5.7). A standard-height header does NOT fit: PCBWay fitted one on rev 2.0 because this line named no exact part (13.5.6). Not Adafruit 2223 (8.5 mm body)."
